<title>USA: Heartland Partners says sells 15.2 acres.</title>
<headline>Heartland Partners says sells 15.2 acres.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Heartland Partners LP said its CMC Heartland Partners unit closed the sale of 15.2 acres within its downtown Chicago Goose Island Industrial Park to Republic Aluminum Inc for about $4.47 million.</p>
<p>Heartland is a master limited partnership. Its CMC Heartland sells, manages and develops commercial, residential and industrial real estate.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
